    "text": "story-llm\nSTORIES\n+ New story\nEntities QA\n✕\nCHARACTERS\nCharacters\nRelationships\n+ New character\nYou\nOld Tom\nbehind the bar\nstained apron\ninnkeeper\nNARRATOR TOOLS\n\nAll tools start on for every story. Entity tools can change persistent world state; dice and image calls can add cost. Turn off any tool independently before writing.\n\nENTITY\nRecord characters\nThe narrator can record character facts and stats, including location and outfit.\nRecord relationships\nThe narrator can record how characters relate and change relationship stats.\nDICE\nRoll uncertain outcomes\nThe narrator may give a chance or reference up to two stored attributes. Rolls read stats but never change them.\nIMAGE\nIllustrate scenes\nThe narrator may illustrate striking moments on its own. See works either way, whenever the image service and key are configured. Images may incur provider charges.\nTRANSCRIPT\nPLAYER ACTIONS\nDo\nSay\nStory\nGuide\nContinue\nSee\nNARRATION\nNarration text\nThoughts (reasoning)\nRECORDS\nDice rolls\nImage prompts\nImage captions\nTool calls\nEntity created\nEntity updated\nEntity deleted\nAttribute changed\nAttribute removed\nAuthor's note updates\nIMAGES\nThe images themselves\nPreview next request\nCONTEXT\nEntities in context\nCharacters\nShown\nHidden\nRelationships\nShown\nHidden\n\nHidden kinds are left out of the entities block. The narrator still sees their changes in history if the Transcript panel includes entity records.\n\nAuthor's note enabled\nAuthor's note\nSave\nTool instructions\nTEXT MODEL\nProvider\nOpenRouter\nNous Portal\nOllama (ollama-dev.greatworkflows.ai)\nModel\nGrok 4.7\nGrok 4.3\nClaude Sonnet 4.5\nHermes 4 70B\nHermes 4 405B\nCustom…\nAPI key (set)\nSave\nIMAGE MODEL\nFEATURES\nText $0.00\nImages $0.00 (0)\nCached input 0\nTotal $0.00\nEntities QA\n\nThe page is blank. Use Do, Say, or Story below to begin.\n\nDo\nSay\nStory\nGuide\nSee\nContinue ⏵\nEnter to send · Shift + Enter for a new line\nEffort\nDefault\nNone\nMinimal\nLow\nMedium\nHigh\nExtra high\nMax\nSend"
  },
